hort enough:** text of length `max` or less comes back unchanged.\n- **Too long:** the result is `max - 1` characters plus \"…\", so it is exactly `max` characters.\n- **Edge cases I chose:** `max` of 0 or less returns `''`, since \"…\" alone would be longer than the limit. `max` of 1 returns just \"…\".\n\nThings I did beyond the literal request:\n- **Test:** added a `truncate` case to `test/index.test.js`.\n- **Changelog:** added an entry under `[Unreleased]` in `CHANGELOG.md`, following the repo's convention.\n\nLength is counted in JavaScript string units (UTF-16 code units), like the rest of the code. Characters outside the Basic Multilingual Plane, such as most emoji, count as two. If you want true code-point counting, I can switch it to `Array.from`.\n\nI did not commit anything. The memory note says you don't want AI co-author lines in commits, so I left those out, as your rule requires.","ttft_ms":2291,"type":"result","duration_ms":14093,"uuid":"0697dc63-0f97-42bc-82ec-c81fcb10c63d","ttft_stream_ms":1775,"time_to_request_ms":492,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":7,"system_prompt":410,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":16,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":3,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":5,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":14,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":17,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":123,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":208,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":128,"process_rss_mib_result":229,"process_anon_mib_result":137,"process_peak_rss_mib":235,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1072,"process_wall_ms_turn":14092,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cp